>> title: Slow Beef Ragu with Pappardelle
>> servings: 4
>> tags: main, pasta
>> time: 2 hours 30 minutes

Brown @beef shin{800%g} in @olive oil{2%tbsp} in a #casserole{}, then set aside.

Soften @onion{1}, @carrot{2} and @celery{2%sticks}, finely diced, for ~{10%minutes}.

Return the beef with @red wine{250%ml}, @tinned tomatoes{700%g}, @beef stock{400%ml}, @bay leaf{2} and @rosemary{1%sprig}.

Cover and cook gently for ~{150%minutes}, then shred the meat.

Toss with cooked @pappardelle{400%g} and @parmesan{60%g}.
